note every integer width; each value converts to long and the sum modulo 256 is the exit status
fn main to int
s = long uchar 200
s = add s long u8 1
s = add s long ushort 300
s = add s long u16 2
s = add s long uint 3
s = add s long u32 4
s = add s long ulong 5
s = add s long u64 6
s = add s long byte -7
s = add s long i8 8
s = add s long short -9
s = add s long i16 10
s = add s long int 11
s = add s long i32 12
s = add s long 13
s = add s i64 14
ret int rem s 256
end
